        <mj-text padding="0 0 8px" color="#33404F" font-size="15px" line-height="1.45">Franz Beard sizes up Florida's route to an upset of Georgia in Atlanta and makes his calls across the SEC.</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0" font-size="14px" font-weight="800" letter-spacing="0.6px"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/the-soothsayer-georgia-in-a-heart-stopper?utm_source=newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=magazine_fl_ga_2026_10_30&utm_content=soothsayer_read" style="color:#0021A5;text-decoration:none;">READ THE COLUMN &rsaquo;</a></mj-text>
