        <mj-text padding="0 0 8px" color="#6B7280" font-size="11px" line-height="1.3">Archive photo by Chris Spears, GatorBait Media</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 4px" color="#C23A0E" font-size="12px" font-weight="800" letter-spacing="1.6px">EDDIE GILLEY · OCT. 30</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 6px" color="#101820" font-size="21px" font-weight="800" line-height="1.15"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/key-to-a-win-in-atlanta?utm_source=newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=magazine_fl_ga_2026_10_30&utm_content=eddie_headline" style="color:#101820;text-decoration:none;">Key to a Win in Atlanta</a></mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 8px" color="#33404F" font-size="15px" line-height="1.45">Eddie Gilley makes the third-down battle Florida's clearest path to an upset of Georgia in Atlanta.</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0" font-size="14px" font-weight="800" letter-spacing="0.6px"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/key-to-a-win-in-atlanta?utm_source=newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=magazine_fl_ga_2026_10_30&utm_content=eddie_read" style="color:#0021A5;text-decoration:none;">READ THE COLUMN &rsaquo;</a></mj-text>
