        <mj-text padding="0 0 6px" color="#101820" font-size="21px" font-weight="800" line-height="1.15"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/will-lightning-strike-twice-for-the-gators?utm_source=newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=magazine_fl_ga_2026_10_30&utm_content=lightning_headline" style="color:#101820;text-decoration:none;">Will lightning strike twice for the Gators?</a></mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 8px" color="#33404F" font-size="15px" line-height="1.45">Franz Beard examines why Florida can challenge Georgia after the Gators and Auburn each pulled off a 27-24 upset.</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0" font-size="14px" font-weight="800" letter-spacing="0.6px"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/will-lightning-strike-twice-for-the-gators?utm_source=newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=magazine_fl_ga_2026_10_30&utm_content=lightning_read" style="color:#0021A5;text-decoration:none;">READ THE COLUMN &rsaquo;</a></mj-text>
