        <mj-text padding="0 0 8px" color="#6B7280" font-size="11px" line-height="1.3">Artwork supplied by GatorBait Media</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 4px" color="#C23A0E" font-size="12px" font-weight="800" letter-spacing="1.6px">BUDDY MARTIN · OCT. 27</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 6px" color="#101820" font-size="21px" font-weight="800" line-height="1.15"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/florida-georgia-sumrall-knows-the-math?utm_source=newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=magazine_fl_ga_2026_10_30&utm_content=buddy_headline" style="color:#101820;text-decoration:none;">Sumrall Knows the Math. He’s Just Not Telling Georgia Who Takes the Snap.</a></mj-text>
